{"text":"purananuru","n":309,"lines":["இரும்புமுகம் சிதைய நூறி ஒன்னார்","இருஞ்சமம் கடத்தல் ஏனோர்க்கும் எளிதே","நல்லரா உறையும் புற்றம் போலவும்","கொல்ஏறு திரிதரு மன்றம் போலவும்","மாற்றருந் துப்பின் மாற்றோர் பாசறை","உளன் என வெரூஉம் ஓர்ஒளி","வலன்உயர் நெடுவேல் என்னைகண் ணதுவே"],"tr":["irumpumukam citaiya nūṟi oṉṉār","iruñcamam kaṭattal ēṉōrkkum eḷitē","nallarā uṟaiyum puṟṟam pōlavum","kolēṟu tiritaru maṉṟam pōlavum","māṟṟarun tuppiṉ māṟṟōr pācaṟai","uḷaṉ eṉa verūum ōroḷi","valaṉuyar neṭuvēl eṉṉaikaṇ ṇatuvē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"tumpai","tinai_ta":"தும்பை","turai_ta":"நூழிலாட்டு","poet_ta":"மதுரை இளங்கண்ணிக் கௌசிகனார்","poet_tr":"Maturai Iḷaṅkaṇṇik Kaucikaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 24, veṇcīr 3"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 16, veṇṭaḷai 7, kalittaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"இரும்புமுகம்","tr":"irumpumukam","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இரும்","tr":"irum"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புமு","tr":"pumu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கம்","tr":"kam"}]},{"text":"சிதைய","tr":"citaiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிதை","tr":"citai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"நூறி","tr":"nūṟi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நூ","tr":"nū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றி","tr":"ṟi"}]},{"text":"யொன்னா","tr":"yoṉṉā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யொன்","tr":"yoṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"}]}],[{"text":"ரிருஞ்சமம்","tr":"riruñcamam","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரிருஞ்","tr":"riruñ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சமம்","tr":"camam"}]},{"text":"கடத்த","tr":"kaṭatta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடத்","tr":"kaṭat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"லேனோர்க்","tr":"lēṉōrk","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோர்க்","tr":"ṉōrk"}]},{"text":"குமெளிதே","tr":"kumeḷitē","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குமெ","tr":"kume"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளிதே","tr":"ḷitē"}]}],[{"text":"நல்லரா","tr":"nallarā","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லரா","tr":"larā"}]},{"text":"வுறையும்","tr":"vuṟaiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுறை","tr":"vuṟai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"புற்றம்","tr":"puṟṟam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புற்","tr":"puṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றம்","tr":"ṟam"}]},{"text":"போலவும்","tr":"pōlavum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லவும்","tr":"lavum"}]}],[{"text":"கொல்லேறு","tr":"kollēṟu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொல்","tr":"kol"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"திரிதரு","tr":"tiritaru","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திரி","tr":"tiri"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தரு","tr":"taru"}]},{"text":"மன்றம்","tr":"maṉṟam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றம்","tr":"ṟam"}]},{"text":"போலவும்","tr":"pōlavum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லவும்","tr":"lavum"}]}],[{"text":"மாற்றருந்","tr":"māṟṟarun","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாற்","tr":"māṟ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றருந்","tr":"ṟarun"}]},{"text":"துப்பின்","tr":"tuppiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"துப்","tr":"tup"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பின்","tr":"piṉ"}]},{"text":"மாற்றோர்","tr":"māṟṟōr","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாற்","tr":"māṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோர்","tr":"ṟōr"}]},{"text":"பாசறை","tr":"pācaṟai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சறை","tr":"caṟai"}]}],[{"text":"யுளனென","tr":"yuḷaṉeṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுள","tr":"yuḷa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னென","tr":"ṉeṉa"}]},{"text":"வெரூஉ","tr":"verūu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வெரூ","tr":"verū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"உ","tr":"u"}]},{"text":"மோரொளி","tr":"mōroḷi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மோ","tr":"mō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரொளி","tr":"roḷi"}]}],[{"text":"வலனுயர்","tr":"valaṉuyar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வல","tr":"vala"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னுயர்","tr":"ṉuyar"}]},{"text":"நெடுவே","tr":"neṭuvē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெடு","tr":"neṭu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]},{"text":"லென்னைகண்","tr":"leṉṉaikaṇ","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லென்","tr":"leṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"}]},{"text":"ணதுவே","tr":"ṇatuvē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணது","tr":"ṇatu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"இரும்புமுகம்","parts":[{"text":"இரும்பு","lemma":"irumpu","gloss":"iron"},{"text":"முகம்","lemma":"mukam","gloss":"face/tip"}],"gloss":"iron-tipped weapons"},{"surface":"சிதைய","parts":[{"text":"சிதை","lemma":"cite","gloss":"shatter"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"to (infinitive)"}],"gloss":"to shatter"},{"surface":"நூறி","parts":[{"text":"நூறு","lemma":"nūṟu","gloss":"crush"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"having (absolutive)"}],"gloss":"having crushed"},{"surface":"ஒன்னார்","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்னார்","lemma":"oṉṉār","gloss":"enemies"}],"gloss":"enemies"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இருஞ்சமம்","parts":[{"text":"இரும்","lemma":"irum","gloss":"great"},{"text":"சமம்","lemma":"camam","gloss":"battle"}],"gloss":"great battle"},{"surface":"கடத்தல்","parts":[{"text":"கட","lemma":"kaṭa","gloss":"cross/win"},{"text":"த்தல்","lemma":"tal","gloss":"act of"}],"gloss":"winning"},{"surface":"ஏனோர்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"ஏனோர்","lemma":"ēṉōr","gloss":"others"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"to"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even to others"},{"surface":"எளிதே","parts":[{"text":"எளிது","lemma":"eḷitu","gloss":"easy thing"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is easy indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்லரா","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"deadly/good"},{"text":"அரா","lemma":"arā","gloss":"cobra"}],"gloss":"deadly cobra"},{"surface":"உறையும்","parts":[{"text":"உறை","lemma":"uṟai","gloss":"dwell"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"that dwells"}],"gloss":"dwelling"},{"surface":"புற்றம்","parts":[{"text":"புற்று","lemma":"puṟṟu","gloss":"anthill"},{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"euphonic increment"}],"gloss":"anthill"},{"surface":"போலவும்","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொல்ஏறு","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"kol","gloss":"kill"},{"text":"ஏறு","lemma":"ēṟu","gloss":"bull"}],"gloss":"killer bull"},{"surface":"திரிதரு","parts":[{"text":"திரி","lemma":"tiri","gloss":"wander"},{"text":"தரு","lemma":"taru","gloss":"auxiliary indicating continuous action"}],"gloss":"roaming"},{"surface":"மன்றம்","parts":[{"text":"மன்றம்","lemma":"maṉṟam","gloss":"public common ground"}],"gloss":"public common ground"},{"surface":"போலவும்","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மாற்றரும்","parts":[{"text":"மாற்று","lemma":"māṟṟu","gloss":"resist"},{"text":"அரும்","lemma":"arum","gloss":"difficult/impossible"}],"gloss":"irresistible"},{"surface":"துப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"துப்பு","lemma":"tuppu","gloss":"strength"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of strength"},{"surface":"மாற்றோர்","parts":[{"text":"மாற்றோர்","lemma":"māṟṟōr","gloss":"enemies"}],"gloss":"enemies"},{"surface":"பாசறை","parts":[{"text":"பாசறை","lemma":"pācaṟai","gloss":"battle camp"}],"gloss":"battle camp"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உளன்","parts":[{"text":"உள்","lemma":"uḷ","gloss":"exist"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he is present"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"say/think"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"to (infinitive)"}],"gloss":"thinking that"},{"surface":"வெரூஉம்","parts":[{"text":"வெரூஉம்","lemma":"வெரூஉம்","gloss":"dreading"}],"gloss":"dreading","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஓர்ஒளி","parts":[{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ōr","gloss":"unique"},{"text":"ஒளி","lemma":"oḷi","gloss":"majesty/luster"}],"gloss":"a unique majestic presence"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வலன்உயர்","parts":[{"text":"வலன்","lemma":"valan","gloss":"victory"},{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"uyar","gloss":"raised"}],"gloss":"victory-raised"},{"surface":"நெடுவேல்","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"neṭu","gloss":"long"},{"text":"வேல்","lemma":"vēl","gloss":"spear"}],"gloss":"long spear"},{"surface":"என்னை","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"my"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"lord/hero"}],"gloss":"my lord"},{"surface":"கண்ணதுவே","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"place/with"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"atu","gloss":"it"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is indeed with him"}]}],"literal":"Crushing so that the iron tips shatter, the enemies / winning the great battle is easy even for others. / Like an anthill where a deadly cobra dwells, / and like a public common ground where a killer bull roams, / in the battle camp of enemies of irresistible strength, / the unique majestic presence that they dread thinking 'he is there', / belongs to my lord of the victory-raised long spear.","translation":"To crush the enemies, shattering their iron weapons, and to win a great battle is easy enough even for ordinary warriors. But like an anthill where a deadly cobra dwells, or a public common ground where a killer bull roams, the unique, terrifying majesty that makes the enemies of irresistible strength tremble in their own camp, thinking 'he is there,' belongs only to my lord with his victory-raised long spear.","modern":"பகைவர்களின் இரும்பு ஆயுதங்கள் சிதறுமாறு அழித்து, பெரிய போர்க்களத்தில் வெற்றி பெறுவது மற்ற வீரர்களுக்கும் எளிதானதே. ஆனால், நல்ல நச்சுப்பாம்பு வாழும் புற்றுப் போலவும், கொலை செய்யும் காளை மாடு திரியும் பொதுமன்று போலவும், வெல்ல முடியாத வலிமையுடைய பகைவர்களின் பாசறையில், 'அவன் இங்கு இருக்கிறான்' என்று எண்ணி அவர்கள் அஞ்சும்படியான ஒப்பற்ற அச்சமூட்டும் பெருமை, வெற்றி பொருந்திய நீண்ட வேலை ஏந்திய என் தலைவனுக்கே உரியது.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the tumpai tiṇai (battle of strength) and the tuṟai is nūḻilāṭṭu (the single-handed havoc caused by a hero). The poet, Maturai Iḷaṅkaṇṇik Kaucihaṉār, praises the terrifying majesty of his hero. He states that while winning a battle by crushing enemies is something even ordinary warriors can achieve, creating a constant state of dread in the enemy camp is unique to his leader. The poet uses two vivid similes: the enemy camp is like an anthill containing a deadly cobra (nallarā) or a common ground where a killer bull (kollēṟu) roams. Even without active combat, the mere suspicion of the hero's presence (uḷaṉ eṉa) makes the powerful enemies tremble in fear. This supreme dread is inspired by the hero who wields the victory-raised long spear (neṭuvēl).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}